WEBVTT

1
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,980
Boss, we did a good job, right?

2
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,980
You know we are useful this time, right?

3
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:31,280
No need to look for it. I have a lot of these at home. Just take them.

4
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:36,620
As long as you don’t dislike these winter melons

5
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:48,020
No. Fresh vegetables are quite rare nowadays. Winter melon is quite good.

6
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,020
I also asked you to send me a special trip. Thank you.

7
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:53,020
Eat more, there are still steamed dumplings at home

8
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:55,020
I'll bring it back to you to eat on the road.

9
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,790
You are so kind
